~ recreation

$> guide.point_at_subject("Has not stopped working")
sai: {{ guide.subject_name() }} has had nothing but work for too long.
sai: Recreation is a need, the same as food. It falls whether or not anyone is watching it, and a crew member who never unwinds becomes a crew member who resigns.
sai: The mess hall counts - people talk over a meal. Make sure it is easy to reach.
sai: Purpose-built recreation counts for a great deal more. When you can afford it, build somewhere that exists only to be pleasant.
=> END
